            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak eaweedida gayghoang'waay gadeem ispwa ng'eedeanagi ak gwayeesha, “Gajeayaaga hamiteanya ak geekwealsheesi geat, ak eaniyean ginung' eeguushteawaneasa gheawungaagu geandeawaneasa baspaseegaasa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yerusalemu gajeadeas",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda eaweedida gayghwanung' NG'UTAMIIDA ghaftu geediga miyaasiin nea ghaambiidaat. Ak haghweega geediga ng'eanyiida gajea miyaasiin muuchi, nea gaba leanga aba fugiga bea Israeli ghuhiin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea dea boos aba Sayuni ea dea sinung'wa Yerusalemu gajeeguura Deaghaydit, nea gilinyoo eang'oar gil duu gwanda aba Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damanda jea goohuuna NG'UTAMIIDA ririnnyeanda haweega Sayuni, nea goohuun foojeanda Yerusalemu mida bugustaanyi aba guroorooda girgweaksiinda ea guroorooda ghaghwarda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba heeda was giibinda sean bea giijeeda Sayuni, ea badayda fugaaschi bwatgeat, gaygwasin NG'UTAMIIDA shamooghooda ea aroosta damandeaba askweari, ea ng'ushapkeaka beasta damandeaba eawa; aba gideaba badayda giigheambiitaanyi sean gajeedukuta ak ghoahaaghwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea giigheambiitaanyi aba heedeanyu gaygawuurji jirooneeda sidukuta aba maheemajeanda askweari, ak ghoah heeda jea eediinya damanda mideewa shaarara ea roopta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
